READ.ME - Last Minute News on B-Tree Filer Version 5.41
=======================================================

To squeeze an ever-growing B-Tree Filer onto the distribution
diskettes, we have had to split the old READ.ME file into two: the
file you are reading now, and a READ.1ST file which has been added to
and compressed into the file FILER.LZH. This READ.1ST file contains
all the latest news of the enhancements to B-Tree Filer and to the
manual.

The FASTUPD.541 file for our Fast Update Plan subscribers has also
been added to and compressed into the FILER.LZH file.

The utilities PRINTDOC.EXE, which will print our documentation files,
and UPGRADE.EXE, which together with DBOX.UPG and FILER.UPG will
upgrade older Database Toolbox and B-Tree Filer 5.0x routine calls
in your source code to version 5.41, have been compressed into a new
archive, UTIL.LZH, on the FILER diskette.
